flowchart LR
  U[User Browser] --> FE[React SPA]
  FE -->|HTTPS + JWT| API[FastAPI Backend]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  API -->|Put, Copy, Delete, ListVersions, Head| S3[(Amazon S3 private versioned bucket)]
  API -->|presigned GET URL| FE
  FE -->|GET via presigned URL| S3
  S3 -->|ObjectCreated:Put event| L[AWS Lambda]
  L -->|GetObject size-limited| S3
  L -->|HTTPS + shared secret| API
  API -->|lambda:InvokeFunction for retry| L
